      <p>Sneakers ~1.5–2.5 kg with box; combine light apparel when the line allows — volumetric weight matters for CBSA-bound parcels.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Line checklist (Canada)</h2>
      <p>Compare economy vs express, tracking, and category rules — budget CBSA screening separately from Superbuy fees.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>CBSA and declared value</h2>
      <p>Honest declared value reduces holds — coupons do not remove GST/HST assessment when applicable.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Tracking gaps Canadians see</h2>
      <p>Export scan gaps before CBSA handoff are common on some economy lines — open tickets with parcel ID ready.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Canada CBSA and GST/HST</h2>
      <p>Budget for possible assessment after arrival — not every parcel is taxed, but honesty reduces holds. Read <a href="/superbuy-shipping-to-canada/">shipping to Canada</a> before paying freight.</p>
    </div>
